{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1011394-spellcasting-cheat-sheet","id":1011394,"title":"Spellcasting Cheat Sheet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-03T00:03:22-08:00","id":1011394,"title":"Spellcasting Cheat Sheet","content":"I just started running a 2E crossover game, and the mages are having trouble keeping the new casting mechanics straight, so I set up a cheat sheet. Figured other people 'round hurr might have use for it too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6dyhuncueniovq8/Mage%20the%20Awakening%202E%20-%20Spellcasting%20Cheat%20Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6dyhuncueniovq8/Mage%20the%20Awakening%202E%20-%20Spellcasting%20Cheat%20Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6dyhuncueniovq8/Mage%20the%20Awakening%202E%20-%20Spellcasting%20Cheat%20Sheet.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/6dyhuncueniovq8/Mage%20the%20Awakening%202E%20-%20Spellcasting%20Cheat%20Sheet.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> One note, the ritual time table is slightly houseruled to have a step every Gnosis increment instead of every two. Otherwise it's all from the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12714-aranaira","name":"AranaiRa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12714_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T03:03:24-08:00","id":1011435,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't mind seeing one of these with the usual ritual casting time.<br /> <br /> In the section for reaching, you have repeated the blurb for Yantras about die limits. I am guessing you meant to have a blurb there about how many free reaches you get.<br /> <br /> A definition for Primary Spell Factor may be helpful to include somewhere, too.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, your section on potency is wrong. (or houseruled) each level of potency past the first = a -2 penalty.<br /> <br /> Potency 1... 0<br /> Potency 2...-2<br /> Potency 3...-4<br /> Potency 4...-6<br /> etc.<br /> <br /> In other words, if you wanted to cast a damaging spell, say, Call Lightning, you first have to decide how much damage you wanted to do with your lightning. A potency 2 lightning bolt would be cast at -2. <br /> <br /> However, since Potency is the primary spell factor for Call Lightning, after all penalties are accounted for, the mage may choose to move potency a number of steps up the chart equal to his primary arcanum-1. so supposing our mage has forces 3, thats 2 steps up the potency chart... for a total potency of 4. <br /> <br /> The way you have written it, I am guessing you are applying any successes on the dice after casting as potency (or duration) at a 1:1 so potency is whatever you rolled on the dice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1078,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","user":"Froggy711","date":". 12-03-2016, 06:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T05:18:30-08:00","id":1011459,"title":"","content":"I've also made a <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">spellcasting cheat sheet</a>, if anyone's interested.<br /> Unless I've made a mistake it should adhere completely to the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T19:25:43-08:00","id":1011788,"title":"","content":"Wow, this looks really professional! Is there any way you could make a version without house rules for general use?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/443-redsypher","name":"RedSypher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar443_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T21:52:10-08:00","id":1011848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1011394-spellcasting-cheat-sheet?p=1011435#post1011435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, your section on potency is wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, we discovered this tonight during play actually! I updated the link to fix it.<br /> <br /> As per by-the-book ritual cast values, I only altered the values at even Gnosis steps. I can put up another one without the adjustments if there's a call for it though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12714,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12714-aranaira","user":"AranaiRa","date":". 12-04-2016, 01:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12714-aranaira","name":"AranaiRa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12714_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T07:40:17-08:00","id":1012010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1011394-spellcasting-cheat-sheet?p=1011459#post1011459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've also made a <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">spellcasting cheat sheet</a>, if anyone's interested.<br /> Unless I've made a mistake it should adhere completely to the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you sure using the Sympathetic attainment requires a reach? I wasn't able to find anything indicating that it fell under the &quot;remote viewing&quot; category. All the spells that use it (such as co-location) indicate that you must cast at sensory range, and then activate the attainment by spending a point of mana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T08:09:30-08:00","id":1012013,"title":"","content":"Sympathetic Range requires Sensory Range which in turn requires a Reach, so I decided to just write +1 Reach instead of writing Sensory Range as a requirement.<br /> <br /> Edit: Sympathetic does not require Remote just like 1 turn casting time doesn't require Gnosis 9-10 in the table just to the right. Entries above the desired entry is not a requirement. You pick the entry you want and get the total cost/requirement for that entry. If you accumulated the costs in the other tables you'd have stuff like a -6 penalty (0 + -2 + -4) to target four subjects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 12-04-2016, 11:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T09:45:40-08:00","id":1012043,"title":"","content":"Ah, that makes sense. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}